    "runtimeAdaptation": "Authored dark slot, sidebar and tab crops retain their original geometry. Because this pack has no button_highlighted sprite, numeric-button hover reuses its toolbar hover crop (212,128,18,20) with a three-pixel nine-slice; hovered numeric text uses the atlas outline color #0a090e. Native GTNH setting glyphs continue to use the installed old AE2 atlas, avoiding modern magenta placeholders. Empty pattern slots alone combine SLOT with the installed GT hint; occupied slots use SLOT and native output/count rendering. Pattern slots disable the underlying MUI2/GT theme background, preventing light default borders from showing through the authored transparent perimeter. Empty upgrade slots draw the native dark BACKGROUND_UPGRADE chip crop after the frame and before hover; occupied slots retain actual card rendering.",
